cff-version: 1.2.0

message: >-
  If you use KoNAMIC, please cite the software and the publication relevant
  to the workflow or experiment you use.

title: >-
  KoNAMIC: Koopman Neural Networks for Aerial Modelling, Identification
  and Control

abstract: >-
  KoNAMIC is a research software framework for learning Koopman-based
  dynamical models from sensor and visual data and using them for prediction
  and closed-loop control.

type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/NBongiovanni/KoNAMIC"

authors:
